From 72011cff091e937213f2d1e98e33fb9d197cf4cc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: arcanite24 <arcaniteamp@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:37:39 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 09/10] AI: count search nodes per search, start think time
 when the search starts, skip searches with nothing to play

The node counter was static, so concurrent AI searches (several AI players, or several games) ate each other's node budget.
A search that waited for one of the shared search threads lost that wait from its think time.
A search with only mana abilities playable copies the game just to pass.
